This is the compact operational index for the `{{PAPER_TITLE}}` revision. It records plan confirmation, current workflow position, execution order, cluster status, accepted page counts, comparison artifacts, and author approval.

## Current state

- **Plan status:** `DRAFT`.
- **Workflow position:** Harness initialized; reviewer import and revision planning have not started.
- **Overall revision:** `INCOMPLETE`.

## Plan status vocabulary

- `DRAFT`: planning has not started or the proposed organization awaits author confirmation; neither authorizes manuscript edits.
- `AUTHOR-CONFIRMED`: the author accepted the grouping and sequence; item decisions may still be pending, and implementation also requires author authorization.

## Cluster status vocabulary

- `NOT-STARTED`: no authorized deliverable work has begun.
- `IN-PROGRESS`: an authorized implementation or correction pass has begun and has not reached author review.
- `AUTHOR-REVIEW`: the latest cumulative comparison is waiting for author inspection.
- `AUTHOR-APPROVED`: the author explicitly accepted the cluster treatment.
- `COMPLETE`: overall revision status only; the final global audit is author-approved and no required work remains.

